        <!-- ── 痛点 section ── -->
        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] text-textMuted uppercase mb-4">// PROBLEM_STATE</h2>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="terminal-card px-4 py-3 flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="mono glow-cyan text-sm shrink-0 mt-0.5">01</span>
              <p class="text-sm text-textSecondary leading-snug">
                消息满天飞，哪条是噪音哪条是信号，<span class="text-textPrimary">自己也说不清</span>
