            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 卡片 3 -->
          <div class="terminal-card px-5 py-5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
              <svg class="shrink-0" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#16ff7a" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
              </svg>
              <span class="font-semibold text-sm text-textPrimary">看不懂就直接问，不用等</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-textSecondary leading-relaxed">
              群里有人同步讨论——看到不懂的K线或期权链直接发进去问。我们承诺：<span class="text-textPrimary">问题不过夜</span>。
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ── 社会证明 / 活跃感数据 ── -->
        <section class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] text-textMuted uppercase mb-4">// COMMUNITY_STATS</h2>
          <div class="terminal-card px-5 py-5">
            <div class="stats-grid">
              <div style="text-align:center;">
                <div class="mono text-2xl font-bold" style="color:#16ff7a;text-shadow:0 0 16px rgba(22,255,122,0.6);">8,200+</div>
