              </div>
              <div style="text-align:center;border-left:1px solid #1e3040;border-right:1px solid #1e3040;">
                <div class="mono text-2xl font-bold" style="color:#00d4ff;text-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(0,212,255,0.5);">365</div>
                <div class="text-xs mt-1" style="color:#445566;">天不断更</div>
              </div>
              <div style="text-align:center;">
                <div class="mono text-2xl font-bold" style="color:#e8f0fe;">5 min</div>
                <div class="text-xs mt-1" style="color:#445566;">每天只要这么久</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- 群里每天在聊什么 -->
            <div style="font-size:11px;color:#445566;margin-bottom:8px;">群里每天在聊什么：</div>
            <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;">
              <span style="background:#1e3040;color:#16ff7a;border:1px solid #16ff7a33;border-radius:4px;padding:4px 10px;font-size:12px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;">大盘技术面解读</span>
              <span style="background:#1e3040;color:#00d4ff;border:1px solid #00d4ff33;border-radius:4px;padding:4px 10px;font-size:12px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;">期权策略讨论</span>
